                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, I discovered the federal Dept. of Health and Human Services arbitrarily asked St. Francis Hospital in Tulsa to extinguish their eternal flame, calling it a safety hazard.\n\nI am enraged at this blatant disregard for religious liberty and federal government overreach.",
