                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "RIGHT NOW: Our taxpayer dollars are going to the World Health Organization. \n\nYes, the same WHO that refused to hold China accountable for the loss of more than a million Americans and thousands of Oklahomans due to COVID-19.\n\nIt's time to LEAVE the globalist WHO!",
