                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The cost of healthcare, and the ever-growing burden of paperwork, has become a massive hardship for both employers and employees. \n\nMy bill puts employees in the driver\u2019s seat when it comes to picking their health care plan, and lets employers financially support their decision.",
